# Android. The Gradle project keeps its own `android/.gitignore` for its build outputs —
# including the ~104 MB of Swift runtime per ABI that `Scripts/build-android.sh` produces.
# Only the packaged artefacts belong here, since a release drops them anywhere.
*.apk
*.aab

